    "captions": true,
    "captionSize": 0.6,
    "lines": [
      {
        "at": 1.4,
        "text": "After the fire, Elyra fell silent."
      },
      {
        "at": 6.2,
        "text": "Ash covered every land. Grey, and cold, and still."
      },
      {
        "at": 12,
        "text": "For a long time, nothing moved."
      },
      {
        "at": 16.2,
        "text": "Then, deep beneath the ash... a light."
      },
      {
        "at": 21.2,
        "text": "Not fire. Something older."
      },
      {
        "at": 24.8,
        "text": "The light of the seas had found the land."
      },
      {
        "at": 29.2,
        "text": "And the land answered."
      },
      {
        "at": 32.4,
        "text": "Seeds that had waited for a thousand ages split open, all at once."
      },
      {
        "at": 38.6,
        "text": "Roots drank the ash. Stems climbed toward the sun."
      },
      {
        "at": 44.6,
        "text": "In a single season, Elyra turned green."
      },
      {
        "at": 49.4,
        "text": "And in the deepest forest, something began to stir."
      }
    ]
  },
